  HolMultiLib.Determinants's dependencies from Session, SessionMultiLib.Vectors
  (with Misc) and SessionLibrary.Permutations, Floor and Products, and
  exports every theorem by name.  Importing this module is
  `needs "Multivariate/determinants.ml"`: its own `needs` are the imports
  below, and each bundle is built by `initialize` when the module is loaded,
  in file order.
-/

